WEBVTT

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:32.153
But mammography has a 10 percent chance
of missed detection.

00:00:32.945 --> 00:00:36.199
Thousands of lives could be lost each year

00:00:36.199 --> 00:00:37.992
because of this 10 percent.

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:43.790
Today, I’m going to introduce
a new technology:

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:46.042
photoacoustic imaging.

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:48.127
As you can see,

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:50.755
it provides a much clearer image,

00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:53.591
leading to a more accurate diagnosis.

00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:57.720
It will be affordable,
just like an ultrasound scan.

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:00.348
It's painless and fast,